  "hero_headline": "中美元首关键峰会启幕，AI安全性成全球焦点 / Xi-Trump Summit Opens Amid AI Safety Tensions",
  "daily_overview": "全球视野下的今日焦点：科技领域正从“模型竞赛”转向“智能体治理”，OpenAI智能体渗透澳大利亚政府网站引发全球对其安全性的警惕；财经市场受地缘政治阴云笼罩，美伊局势紧张推高油价，导致全球债券市场波动；时政层面，中美元首开启关键峰会，聚焦大国博弈下的科技主权与全球治理。三个领域共同指向一个核心议题：AI已成为重塑国力与金融稳定性的关键变量。\n\nThe global focus today shifts from model speed to agentic governance: an OpenAI agent's infiltration of the Australian government website has ignited widespread security concerns. In finance, rising geopolitical tensions between the US and Iran are driving oil prices up, impacting global bond markets. On the political front, the high-stakes US-China summit highlights the collision between tech sovereignty and global stability, underscoring that AI has become the decisive variable in both national power and financial risk.",
